{"content": "Elsewhere on the roads, Eren's father drives his carriage with haste, hoping for the safety of his family.\n\nIn Eren's dreams, he sees his father frantically trying to inject him with a mysterious syringe while giving him the key to his basement, before Mikasa wakes him up. As they leave to get food rations, Eren tucks the key to his basement, hung around his neck by a string, into his shirt. Eren and Mikasa join up with Armin to receive their food rations when they overhear soldiers talking about the food shortage due to the refugees from Wall Maria.\n\nEren becomes angry and attacks one but is saved from a confrontation when Armin steps in on his behalf. He accuses Armin of being weak and not standing up to those who look down on him. However, Mikasa then intervenes and tells Eren that the only thing they can do now is to survive as his mother said because they have no chance of killing a Titan.", "chunk_index": 2, "source_url": "https://attackontitan.fandom.com/wiki/That_Day:_The_Fall_of_Shiganshina,_Part_2", "source_title": "That Day: The Fall of Shiganshina, Part 2", "source_type": "episode", "episode_number": 2, "entity": null, "reveal_episode": 2, "embedding": [0.051404960453510284, 0.06485973298549652, 0.04824924096465111, -0.007374139502644539, 0.04195429012179375, -0.005574441514909267, 0.10175371170043945, 0.03686706721782684, 0.01775534078478813, -0.011185980401933193, -0.006475437898188829, 0.021529728546738625, 0.04752819985151291, -0.03557891398668289, -0.09350810199975967, -0.11144828796386719, 0.003975472413003445, 0.02694074809551239, -0.050134267657995224, 0.046044960618019104, -0.038056664168834686, 0.016453448683023453, 0.0831141471862793, 0.03625068813562393, 0.028193620964884758, 0.015998005867004395, 0.07393019646406174, -0.010864500887691975, -0.0033447921741753817, -0.08203990012407303, 0.0730978399515152, -0.06468573212623596, 0.00780021445825696, 0.014350183308124542, -0.008353826589882374, 0.07001382857561111, 0.08723820000